<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I really was thinking</font></font>

676
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about your health.</font></font>

677
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

678
00:24:44,590 --> 00:24:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of this matters now.</font></font>

679
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all my fault. I...</font></font>

680
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I shouldn't have</font></font>

681
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">made you feel like</font></font>

682
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had no plan</font></font>

683
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for our future.</font></font>

684
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The truth is,</font></font>

685
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I do have a plan.</font></font>

686
00:24:57,350 --> 00:24:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you just got divorced.</font></font>

687
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid you have baggage when it comes to</font></font>

688
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">family life.</font></font>

689
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've actually thought through everything</font></font>

690
00:25:04,070 --> 00:25:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for our future!</font></font>

691
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Never mind.</font></font>

692
00:25:10,550 --> 00:25:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't even know why I'm</font></font>

693
00:25:11,310 --> 00:25:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">telling you all this now.</font></font>

694
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:14,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually came here today</font></font>

695
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to make you...</font></font>

696
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just... just pick one.</font></font>

697
00:25:16,680 --> 00:25:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm begging you.</font></font>

698
00:25:34,270 --> 00:25:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Adults don't make choices.</font></font>

699
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't I just pick both?</font></font>

700
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No! You can only pick one...</font></font>

701
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're picking both?</font></font>

702
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you make it three?</font></font>

703
00:26:24,590 --> 00:26:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean?</font></font>

704
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't forget about me.</font></font>

705
00:27:02,340 --> 00:27:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lushui Lake Digital Economy Annual Conference]</font></font>

706
00:27:21,830 --> 00:27:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is on me. I let him down.</font></font>

707
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I knew</font></font>

708
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all he wanted was to apologize to Mr. Liu.</font></font>

709
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But the second Mr. Kai said</font></font>

710
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">another partner would replace him,</font></font>

711
00:27:34,030 --> 00:27:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wavered.</font></font>

712
00:27:36,550 --> 00:27:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because my biggest fear</font></font>

713
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is being replaced.</font></font>

714
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All I thought about</font></font>

715
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was solving the All Buy mess</font></font>

716
00:27:46,270 --> 00:27:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the safest way.</font></font>

717
00:27:47,830 --> 00:27:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I never</font></font>

718
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">looked at it from his side.</font></font>

719
00:27:50,270 --> 00:27:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So</font></font>

720
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether as his assistant, his subordinate,</font></font>

721
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or</font></font>

722
00:27:56,310 --> 00:27:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his fiancée,</font></font>

723
00:27:58,030 --> 00:27:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I am</font></font>

724
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a total traitor.</font></font>

725
00:28:02,070 --> 00:28:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So when he walked away disappointed,</font></font>

726
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

727
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've got nothing to say.</font></font>

728
00:28:06,830 --> 00:28:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't even</font></font>

729
00:28:07,270 --> 00:28:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">feel like I have</font></font>

730
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the right to go after him.</font></font>

731
00:28:13,790 --> 00:28:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not that serious.</font></font>

732
00:28:15,270 --> 00:28:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In the video, he just said</font></font>

733
00:28:17,030 --> 00:28:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he needed to clear his head.</font></font>

734
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'll be back soon.</font></font>

735
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He won't come back for me.</font></font>

736
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That video...</font></font>

737
00:28:27,790 --> 00:28:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He only gave me an out because he was worried</font></font>

738
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about me and wanted to comfort me.</font></font>

739
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Du later told me</font></font>

740
00:28:33,590 --> 00:28:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xinzhi's dad</font></font>

741
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">used to be a quality inspector too.</font></font>

742
00:28:36,960 --> 00:28:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After getting laid off in the 1990s,</font></font>

743
00:28:38,550 --> 00:28:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he borrowed money to do business.</font></font>

744
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then</font></font>

745
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he jumped off a rooftop</font></font>

746
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in front of Xinzhi.</font></font>

747
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So Xinzhi's scared of heights.</font></font>

748
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even so,</font></font>

749
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'd always stand up there</font></font>

750
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with me just because I loved</font></font>

751
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the view from the rooftop.</font></font>

752
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I never once thought</font></font>

753
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about</font></font>

754
00:29:03,550 --> 00:29:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what was behind his fear.</font></font>

755
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:14,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

756
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at it this way, Xu.</font></font>

757
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You got promoted.</font></font>

758
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got your own team.</font></font>

759
00:29:19,790 --> 00:29:21,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And the project's about to deliver.</font></font>

760
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that great?</font></font>

761
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

762
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's great.</font></font>

763
00:29:25,070 --> 00:29:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In a few years,</font></font>

764
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll make partner.</font></font>

765
00:29:27,270 --> 00:29:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at me.</font></font>

766
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't even know how long I'll be</font></font>

767
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stuck as director</font></font>

768
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on this new project.</font></font>

769
00:29:32,310 --> 00:29:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't stress.</font></font>

770
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you know?</font></font>

771
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her dad's actually</font></font>

772
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">teaching her how to</font></font>

773
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">run the company now.</font></font>

774
00:29:38,310 --> 00:29:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In two years,</font></font>

775
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she'll be running the new energy subsidiary on her own.</font></font>

776
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:44,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So your problems are all solved.</font></font>

777
00:29:45,070 --> 00:29:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The biggest problem now is me.</font></font>

778
00:29:47,030 --> 00:29:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanna get into real business.</font></font>

779
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master Xu, you know everyone.</font></font>

780
00:29:51,510 --> 00:29:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help me get a referral, please.</font></font>

781
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. I'll refer you right now.</font></font>

782
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:58,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ms. Bu,</font></font>

783
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what do you think of this guy?</font></font>

784
00:30:06,750 --> 00:30:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ms. Bu, what do you think of me?</font></font>

785
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want?</font></font>

786
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't dare want anything.</font></font>

787
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

788
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

789
00:31:18,060 --> 00:31:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Courtyard No. 92, Yong'an Road]</font></font>

790
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leaving?</font></font>

791
00:31:25,070 --> 00:31:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hua, you're heading out? Take care.</font></font>

792
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Done.</font></font>

793
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Done. Just fifteen minutes.</font></font>

794
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You gotta be out by then.</font></font>

795
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great.</font></font>

796
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I couldn't get the place for you.</font></font>

797
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:43,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I had to make good</font></font>

798
00:31:43,350 --> 00:31:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on that big bonus you gave me.</font></font>

799
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard from the city</font></font>

800
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that after reinforcing the houses affected</font></font>

801
00:31:47,550 --> 00:31:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">by the collapse,</font></font>

802
00:31:48,350 --> 00:31:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they're letting one person per household</font></font>

803
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">go in during designated times</font></font>

804
00:31:49,830 --> 00:31:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to grab essentials,</font></font>

805
00:31:50,790 --> 00:31:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I signed you up for it.</font></font>

806
00:31:52,070 --> 00:31:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you so much.</font></font>

807
00:31:53,550 --> 00:31:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll head in now.</font></font>

808
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello.</font></font>

809
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi.</font></font>

810
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. It's pretty dangerous in there.</font></font>

811
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Quick in, quick out.</font></font>

812
00:33:21,030 --> 00:33:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then let's buy this place.</font></font>

813
00:33:24,590 --> 00:33:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have that kind of money.</font></font>

814
00:33:26,310 --> 00:33:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got me.</font></font>

815
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me a chance</font></font>

816
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to do what a boyfriend should do.</font></font>

817
00:33:33,550 --> 00:33:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright?</font></font>

818
00:33:39,510 --> 00:33:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu.</font></font>

819
00:33:40,830 --> 00:33:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Time to go.</font></font>

820
00:33:42,070 --> 00:33:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The staff outside are rushing us.</font></font>

821
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

822
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait, Xu.</font></font>

823
00:33:49,960 --> 00:33:51,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about you take this?</font></font>

824
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just as a keepsake.</font></font>

825
00:33:53,590 --> 00:33:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If this place really gets torn down next week,</font></font>

826
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there'll be nothing left.</font></font>

827
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a few photos.</font></font>

828
00:34:07,830 --> 00:34:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry down.</font></font>

829
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I used to think this apartment</font></font>

830
00:34:24,110 --> 00:34:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was worth giving everything for.</font></font>

831
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But only now</font></font>

832
00:34:26,670 --> 00:34:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do I finally get it...</font></font>

833
00:34:29,710 --> 00:34:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't get anything at all.</font></font>

834
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xinzhi?</font></font>

835
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really you!</font></font>

836
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ikkyu-san?</font></font>

837
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing in Iraq?</font></font>

838
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I</font></font>

839
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">even consulted you before.</font></font>

840
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:19,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You forgot?</font></font>

841
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The refinery I'm in charge of building</font></font>

842
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is 200 kilometers that way.</font></font>

843
00:35:24,070 --> 00:35:24,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm on leave today.</font></font>

